  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.05,
      "end_seconds": 7.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Hi there, the chair's free, sit down. Did you find the place alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.81,
      "end_seconds": 14.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "um, yes, it was easy enough. The parking was the hard part"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.05,
      "end_seconds": 19.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "What would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.68,
      "end_seconds": 32.62,
      "duration_seconds": 12.94,
      "text": "I've been wanting contraception, and I wanted to get it checked i told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.84,
      "end_seconds": 37.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.54,
      "end_seconds": 49.26,
      "duration_seconds": 10.72,
      "text": "It's been going on for two weeks. Slightly heavy periods was there, but it's gone away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.74,
      "end_seconds": 69.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.59,
      "end_seconds": 81.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.29,
      "end_seconds": 104.87,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 68 beats a minute, blood pressure 114 over 79, temperature is 36.6 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.37,
      "end_seconds": 108.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.61,
      "end_seconds": 113.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "tell me if that's sore"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.99,
      "end_seconds": 129.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.29,
      "end_seconds": 137.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. And what about breast lumps or migraine with aura?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.48,
      "end_seconds": 141.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.38,
      "end_seconds": 144.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. What about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.75,
      "end_seconds": 147.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "No smoking, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.08,
      "end_seconds": 152.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.29,
      "end_seconds": 155.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.64,
      "end_seconds": 159.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "how are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.18,
      "end_seconds": 163.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.51,
      "end_seconds": 167.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.55,
      "end_seconds": 172.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "My aunt has rheumatoid arthritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.09,
      "end_seconds": 185.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.92,
      "end_seconds": 190.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.06,
      "end_seconds": 197.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.49,
      "end_seconds": 203.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.91,
      "end_seconds": 208.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.55,
      "end_seconds": 213.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.79,
      "end_seconds": 220.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.9,
      "end_seconds": 229.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "I've got thin bones. I've been putting this off for weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.27,
      "end_seconds": 231.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.78,
      "end_seconds": 236.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "I have diabetes, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.89,
      "end_seconds": 245.73,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "Alright, diabetes, that matches what I have here. Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.53,
      "end_seconds": 252.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "mm, I'm on glimepiride, 2 milligrams, before breakfast"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.98,
      "end_seconds": 256.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.98,
      "end_seconds": 272.55,
      "duration_seconds": 15.57,
      "text": "Just a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.02,
      "end_seconds": 311.24,
      "duration_seconds": 20.22,
      "text": "Putting it all together, the most likely explanation is suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors. What I'm giving you is levonorgestrel and ethinylestradiol, 150 micrograms and 30 micrograms, once a day, long term. You take it by mouth. That should help with contraception."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.83,
      "end_seconds": 314.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "that's simple enough"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.03,
      "end_seconds": 342.5,
      "duration_seconds": 26.47,
      "text": "Take the pill at the same time each day and use condoms if you miss two. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. One warning sign to remember: you get leg swelling or severe headaches. In that case don't wait. See me again in three months. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.12,
      "end_seconds": 347.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "okay, that that makes sense. Thanks for explaining"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.51,
      "end_seconds": 350.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "So, take care now."
    }
  ]
}